{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（20日）上午8時39分，警方接報大圍金禧花園泳池內，一名年約30歲女子疑遇溺，昏迷不醒。救援人員到場，女子陷入昏迷 ，由救護車送往威爾斯親王醫院搶救。警方正調查事發原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167057434125144064089452.jpeg/WMg2K8--u49rPC542T3DA79tXUfWMhkv8VIwxdRSMMU\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是金禧花園。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167057431256109056257340.jpeg/_Qi3gSl-t4ukV1SOLrSA63hFi8p7dn2Ylz_TSbI_00k\"/><figcaption>現場是金禧花園。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260820/1167057200833630208659042.jpeg/aUBkYZNoCROIjjbwXGU3YrRvJsbDIUpmNgDVdBMA1XQ\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"威爾斯親王醫院。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260105/1084874074443747328678105.jpeg/pbu_YLPAImmulC4UltI4zApYEalDEh6On8N-ubrDfrk\"/><figcaption>威爾斯親王醫院。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T03:00:25.531795+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}